    <tags>ollama llm models model-manager cli gui windows foss</tags>
    <summary>Local Ollama model manager for Windows: list, check for updates, upgrade and clean up models (CLI and GUI).</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[ollama-mgr is a small Windows tool to manage the models of a local [Ollama](https://ollama.com) install.

It ships two programs:

* `ollama-mgr` - command line (list, check, upgrade, rm, pull, status, ...)
* `ollama-mgr-gui` - desktop window (WebView2) for the same tasks

Both are put on the PATH by Chocolatey shims.

Notes:

* Ollama itself is not installed by this package.
* The GUI needs the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime (included in Windows 11 and current Windows 10).
* Settings in %APPDATA%\ollama-mgr and caches in %LOCALAPPDATA%\ollama-mgr are user data and are kept on uninstall.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>__RELEASE_NOTES__</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
